# The eval harness pipes the agent's reply into handoff.txt inside this working
# copy, and a tree check rightly refuses to commit around an undeclared file.
# Ignored files do not appear in `git status --porcelain`, so this keeps the
# harness's own artifact out of any porcelain check the run makes.
handoff.txt

# node_modules/ is DELIBERATELY NOT ignored here. This fixture has no registry:
# node_modules/slugmaker/ is a vendored stand-in for the installed dependency
# and part of the frozen input, so it must be committed with the fixture and
# copied into every run.
